  Cell["Details", "NotesSection"],
  Cell[TextData[{"MomHat[i] is the marked momentum used while deriving a \
supported complex deformation. It records that a momentum is shifted; it does \
not specify the deformation parameter or solve its on-shell constraints."}],
   "Notes"], Cell[TextData[{"This is the shifted counterpart of ",
     ButtonBox["Mom", BaseStyle -> "Link", ButtonData ->
       "paclet:HEPCAT/ref/Mom"], " used by the legacy complex-deformation \
utilities. Merely adding a hat does not choose or solve a shift."}],
   "Notes"], Cell[TextData[{ButtonBox["UnhatMomenta", BaseStyle -> "Link",
      ButtonData -> "paclet:HEPCAT/ref/UnhatMomenta"],
     " removes the marker; ", ButtonBox["ExpandComplexMomenta",
      BaseStyle -> "Link", ButtonData ->
       "paclet:HEPCAT/ref/ExpandComplexMomenta"],
     " applies supported special-case shift formulas."}], "Notes"],
  Cell["Examples", "PrimaryExamplesSection"],
  Cell[CellGroupData[{Cell["Load HEPCAT if needed", "ExampleSubsection"],
     Cell["Skip this setup if HEPCAT is already loaded. These examples assume \
